{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24841","headline":"经端溪峡中 · 杨衡","name":"经端溪峡中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴岸东流水，上有微风生。\n素羽漾翠涧，碧苔敷丹英。\n重林宿雨晦，远岫孤霞明。\n飞猱相攀牵，白云乱纵横。\n有客泝轻檝，阅胜匪羁程。\n逍遥一息间，粪土五侯荣。\n搴茗庶蠲热，漱泉聊析酲。\n寄言丝竹者，讵识松风声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}